    "question_type": "午前",
    "question_text": "2分探索法（二分探索法）で、配列の要素数が $n$ のとき、最大比較回数は何回か。",
    "has_image": false,
    "has_choice_table": false,
    "choice_table_type": null,
    "choice_table_markdown": null,
    "created_at": "2025-09-01T09:17:21.791261+00:00",
    "is_checked": false,
    "checked_at": null,
    "checked_by": null,
    "explanation": "2分探索法は、ソート済み配列で中央値と比較して探索範囲を半分に絞る方法です。\n\n- 1回の比較で探索範囲が半分になる\n- 最大比較回数 = ⌈log₂n⌉\n- n個の要素から1個になるまでの分割回数",
    "exam_id": "05512209-37f5-4b14-9b36-4605f5cf0038",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "ba06a4c5-41aa-4809-9714-dcb940e47a32",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": false,
        "choice_text": "n",
        "choice_label": "ア",
        "choice_images": []
      },
      {
        "id": "c07046b2-3bf4-49dd-bd07-379f36ef40e8",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": false,
        "choice_text": "n/2",
        "choice_label": "イ",
        "choice_images": []
      },
      {
        "id": "b84ef17b-1bab-4881-8a7f-19eb56528aea",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": true,
        "choice_text": "$\\log_2 n$",
        "choice_label": "ウ",
        "choice_images": []
      },
      {
        "id": "a6aef098-191b-404d-aa95-7d4f3ac13e05",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": false,
        "choice_text": "$n \\log_2 n$",
        "choice_label": "エ",
        "choice_images": []
      }
    ],
    "categories": null,
    "question_images": []
  },
  {
    "id": "240993b2-e6f5-42e3-8a58-39a2c1006435",
    "question_number": 8,
    "question_type": "午前",
    "question_text": "バブルソートの時間計算量はどれか。",
    "has_image": false,
    "has_choice_table": false,
    "choice_table_type": null,
    "choice_table_markdown": null,
    "created_at": "2025-09-01T09:17:21.974618+00:00",
    "is_checked": false,
    "checked_at": null,
    "checked_by": null,
    "explanation": "バブルソートは隣接要素を比較・交換する単純なソートアルゴリズムです。\n\n- 最悪の場合: O(n²) - すべての要素が逆順\n- 平均的な場合: O(n²)\n- 最良の場合: O(n) - すでにソート済み（改良版）",
    "exam_id": "05512209-37f5-4b14-9b36-4605f5cf0038",
    "choices": [
      {
        "id": "3fa4e642-68d8-47ba-b44a-0d7d77fdc50e",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": false,
        "choice_text": "$O(n)$",
        "choice_label": "ア",
        "choice_images": []
      },
      {
        "id": "b561a642-bcc3-44e1-b596-4e05fb6d012c",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": false,
        "choice_text": "$O(n \\log n)$",
        "choice_label": "イ",
        "choice_images": []
      },
      {
        "id": "e8cd9523-ab72-4fc9-a52d-152f182b5613",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": true,
        "choice_text": "$O(n^2)$",
        "choice_label": "ウ",
        "choice_images": []
      },
      {
        "id": "b88d02bd-5829-42e2-a9bb-107fe85578d3",
        "has_image": false,
        "is_correct": false,
        "choice_text": "$O(2^n)$",
        "choice_label": "エ",
        "choice_images": []
      }
    ],
    "categories": null,
    "question_images": []
  },
